5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious which of these records you think will actually change our minds before we vote.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the roster books. We keep promising services we can’t staff. Who else is checking the crew numbers?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m leaning toward the journey audits. I want to see where the minutes actually go, not just where the complaints land.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am drawn to the joint operators' minutes. I need to know who else must agree before we can move forward.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am looking at the capital ledger balances. I want to see what we are truly committed to paying in the years after the initial cost.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,I’m checking the two pilots from eight years ago. I want to see if the late-evening pilot actually hit its cost-recovery target before we get excited.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the crew establishment and maintenance contract. I need to know if we have spare capacity or if we’re just borrowing from the future.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’ll also look into the timed runs and crowd counts. I want to verify if the crowding complaints match the actual data.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will also examine the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I need to know what the ground might hide before we trust any delivery date.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the ticketing contractor fees. I want to see if those annual costs are quietly eating into our future flexibility.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’m just confirming my picks. The pilots and the closure reports. I want to see if we’re repeating history or actually learning.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’m confirming my picks: the roster books and the crew establishment. I need to know exactly how thin the late-turn pool is before we promise anything.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I’m confirming my picks: the journey audits and the timed runs. I need to see where the time actually goes, not just where the noise is loudest.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I confirm my choices: the joint operators' minutes and the contingency pricing. I must understand the approvals and the hidden risks before trusting any schedule.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I confirm my choices: the capital ledger and the ticketing fees. I need to see the long-term commitments before we argue about the headline numbers.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"I’m just making sure we’re not chasing ghosts. If the old pilots worked, why are we reinventing the wheel?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Fair point. But a pilot that worked eight years ago doesn’t staff the rosters we have today. Let’s see the numbers.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. Let’s see if the stopwatch matches the shouting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Let us see if the ground holds firm, as it often does not.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us see if the ledger tells the truth about what we can actually afford to keep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
